{"id":"99273534f93e4ad1","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-min-closure-rec.md","title":"Recursive Predicates are Closed Under Minimization","display":"thm-min-closure-rec — Recursive Predicates are Closed Under Minimization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-min-closure-rec","aliases":["90-thm-min-closure-rec"],"display":"thm-min-closure-rec — Recursive Predicates are Closed Under Minimization","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-min-closure-rec"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-min-closure-rec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-min-closure-rec — Recursive Predicates are Closed Under Minimization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P\">\\(\\chi_P\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a> 的布尔特征函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:=\\mu P\">\\(f:=\\mu P\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a> 的最小化部分函数图；元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。自然数语境保留原引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\land\n\\bigl(f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\land\n\\bigl(f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>给定参数依次对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=0,1,\\ldots\">\\(y=0,1,\\ldots\\)</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P(\\vec x,y)\">\\(\\chi_P(\\vec x,y)\\)</span>，遇到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 即返回当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>。每次判定终止，因此最先返回的值正是定义的最小见证；若没有见证则算法发散。故它计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，且其全性恰好等价于所列存在条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补全原来的搜索算法与总性条件；未把有时不终止的无界搜索误称为全递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 的唯一空参数元组也按同一规则处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-min-operator-generalized","status":"resolved","id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$；$\\chi_P$ 是 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]] 的布尔特征函数。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-min-operator-generalized","status":"resolved","id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:=\\mu P$ 取 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]] 的最小化部分函数图；元数为 $k$。自然数语境保留原引用 [[90-df-omega]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:=\\mu P$ 取 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]] 的最小化部分函数图；元数为 $k$。自然数语境保留原引用 [[90-df-omega]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 取 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P","display":false},{"tex":"f:=\\mu P","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\land\n\\bigl(f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ P(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"y=0,1,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P(\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"自然数良序性给出唯一的最小见证。图、定义域与点值记号的适用范围均已在 Assertion 中给出；关系本身不预设可计算。计算性结论仍使用 [[90-thm-min-closure-rec]] 的额外前提。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["137d75d038de4a47","523fadf1703582fe","e860bc8bff2a4e39","9846c377383d14c1"]}